## 二、附加条款 / Additional Terms（中英对照）

本节是对 PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0 的**附加条件**。
当本节与第三节原文冲突时，**以本节为准**（This section prevails over the PolyForm text below in case of conflict）。

1. **Commercial training is a commercial purpose.**
   Using the software, or any part or modified version of it, as teaching material, course content,
   exercises or demos in any **paid** course, training program, bootcamp, corporate in-house training
   or paid online/video content is **not** a permitted purpose, regardless of the nature or funding
   source of the organization providing it.
   （以本项目或其任何部分/改写版本作为付费课程、培训班、企业内训、付费视频等教学内容，
   无论提供方的机构性质或资金来源如何，均不属于允许的非商业用途。）

2. **Prior written permission and fees.**
   Any commercial use requires prior written permission from the licensor (email confirmation suffices);
   licensing fees may be negotiated. Use without such permission constitutes copyright infringement.

3. **Attribution.**
   All copies and derivative works must retain this LICENSE file, the copyright notice and the
   SPDX headers in source files.

